{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/pulls/578","id":4724002676,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUpvcvc8AAAABGZKPdA","html_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/578","diff_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/578.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Niko1221/Strata/pull/578.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/issues/578","number":578,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve multi-GPU decode performance via optimized expert-helper execution","user":{"login":"zhedang","id":197594836,"node_id":"U_kgDOC8cO1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/197594836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang","html_url":"https://github.com/zhedang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhedang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR improves multi-GPU decode performance by making the primary GPU and\r\nexpert-helper GPUs cooperate more efficiently.\r\n\r\nThe optimized **v2.2 expert-helper path** delivers substantial decode speedups\r\nover both the previous expert-helper path and the automatic layer-split path.\r\n\r\n### Speedup summary\r\n\r\n| GPUs / Version | Compared against | Mixed | Code | Math20 |\r\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| RTX 5090 + RTX 4090 / 0.1.38 | Original expert-helper | **+28%** | **+63%** | **+42%** |\r\n| RTX 5090 + RTX 4090 / 0.1.38 | Automatic layer split | **+17%** | **+16%** | **+18%** |\r\n| Dual RTX 4090 / 0.1.37 | Original expert-helper | **+63%** | **+132%** | — |\r\n| Dual RTX 4090 / 0.1.37 | Automatic layer split | **+13%** | **+34%** | — |\r\n\r\n> Enabled with `--remote-expert-opt`. Disabled by default.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Benchmarks\r\n\r\n### RTX 5090 + RTX 4090 — 0.1.38\r\n\r\nDecode throughput, in tokens/s:\r\n\r\n| Configuration | Mixed | Code | Math20 |\r\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| Original expert helper | 135.49 | 152.56 | 158.61 |\r\n| Automatic layer split | 147.41 | 213.89 | 191.06 |\r\n| **Optimized expert helper** | **173.04** | **248.38** | **226.00** |\r\n\r\n### Dual RTX 4090 — 0.1.37\r\n\r\nDecode throughput, in tokens/s:\r\n\r\n| Configuration | Mixed | Code |\r\n|---|---:|---:|\r\n| Original expert helper | 88.07 | 85.15 |\r\n| Automatic layer split | 126.86 | 146.95 |\r\n| **Optimized expert helper** | **143.35** | **197.58** |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## What changed\r\n\r\n- **Complementary expert caches**  \r\n  Keep the primary and helper GPU expert caches complementary, reducing\r\n  duplicated experts and CPU fallback.\r\n\r\n- **Lower inter-GPU transfer volume**  \r\n  Reduce weighted expert outputs on helper GPUs before returning results.\r\n\r\n- **Skip unnecessary CPU quantization**  \r\n  Avoid CPU activation quantization when all selected experts are served by GPUs.\r\n\r\n- **Automatic helper-cache sizing**  \r\n  Add `auto` sizing based on available VRAM, removing the need to manually tune\r\n  expert counts.\r\n\r\nThe existing primary/helper GPU layout remains unchanged.","created_at":"2026-10-03T04:18:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T05:32:38Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a2deecd8e1e64be8ea18d084b8dadcdc17ed02f5","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Niko1221/Strata/pulls/578/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/